# MongoDB schema fragment.
# @requires eks-platform
#
# MONGODB_REPLICA_COUNT, MONGODB_STORAGE_CLASS, MONGODB_IMAGE_REPO,
# MONGODB_OPERATOR_VERSION, MONGODB_BACKUP_ENABLED, and MONGODB_BACKUP_SCHEDULE
# were removed 2026-07-31 (Issue #4): declared here since Phase 3 planning but
# never consumed by any script, Terraform module, or Kubernetes manifest
# (verified via repo-wide search, including scripts/lib/packages/30-mongodb/).
# The real values are hardcoded directly in k8s/base/psmdb-cluster.yaml
# (replsets[0].size: 3, storageClassName: gp3-mongodb, backup.enabled: true,
# backup.tasks[0].schedule: "0 2 * * *") -- see
# docs/references/mongodb-platform-contract.md for the documented mapping.
# MONGODB_NAMESPACE (genuinely consumed) lives in base.manifest, not here.
